  "canon:title": "Thoracic hematomyelia secondary to coumadin anticoagulant therapy: a case report.",
  "canon:abstract": "A case of thoracic hematomyelia secondary to anticoagulant therapy is presented. Clinical features, similar to 2 other previously reported cases, are discussed. A high index of suspicion may lead to a quick diagnostic procedure and successful decompressive surgery.",
